<title>USA: Eskimo Pie Corp Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Eskimo Pie Corp Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			    n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,000   profit	   199</p>
<p> Sales		     12,100		   15,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary loss	 $0.59   profit	 $1.46</p>
<p> Shr diluted loss	  0.54   profit	  1.42</p>
<p> Net	loss	    2,046   profit	 5,076</p>
<p> Sales		     74,084		   83,975</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary   3,460,729		3,475,119</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted   3,623,296		3,637,686</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include previously reported special Q3 charges of about $1.5 million after related tax benefits. Net loss excluding the special charges was $564,000, or $0.13 per share on a fully diluted basis vs profit $5.1 million.</p>
<p>The company did not provide Q4 per share figures.</p>
